DATA (data/) — NOT YET LICENSED.

Rows in data/ are derived from external catalogues maintained by other organisations.
Redistribution permission has not been requested from any of them; data/sources.tsv
records license_status = not-yet-requested for every external source.

Facts are not copyrightable in the United States, but the selection and arrangement of
a catalogue can be, database rights differ in other jurisdictions, and some individual
animal names carry obligations that have nothing to do with copyright.

Until each source in data/sources.tsv has a resolved license_status, treat data/ as
unlicensed and do not redistribute it as a dataset.
